            <ArticleTitle>Proximal mandibular nerve block, using electrolocation, for rostral mandibulectomy in a geriatric dog.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>515-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a case of proximal mandibular nerve block with ropivacaine, using electrolocation, for perioperative pain management in a geriatric dog undergoing rostral mandibulectomy. The patient did not require intraoperative analgesia or analgesic supplementation for 8 h after the end of the surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
